                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musa mtumishi wangu amefariki; sasa ondoka, vuka mto huu wa Yordani; wewe na watu hawa wote, mkaende hadi nchi niwapayo wana wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.2",
