                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Likumbukeni neno lile alilowaamuru Musa mtumishi wa BWANA, akisema, BWANA, Mungu wenu, anawapa ninyi raha, naye atawapa nchi hii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wake zenu, na watoto wenu, na makundi yenu, watakaa katika nchi aliyowapa Musa ng'ambo ya Yordani; bali ninyi mtawatangulia ndugu zenu kuvuka, mkiwa mmevaa silaha zenu, watu wote wenye nguvu, na ushujaa, ili mpate kuwasaidia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
